Subject: [PATCH] search: require per-engine consent for remote suggestions

Remote search suggestions send what the user types, keystroke by
keystroke, to a search engine. Upstream gates them with global switches
only: once suggestions are on, typing "@engine text" sends the text to
that engine even if the user only meant to allow their default engine.

SearchSuggestionController is the single place that fetches remote
suggestions and trending searches (address bar, search bar, new tab
search box). This adds one more condition there: the engine's id must
be listed in the pref nulavio.search.suggest.optin, which Nulavio's
search settings write when the user switches suggestions on for a
provider. The pref is empty by default, so no engine receives typed
text until the user opts in. Local suggestions (history, form history)
are unaffected.

Owner: Nulavio maintainers
Upstream: not proposed yet (product policy; see docs/adr/0002-nulavio-search.md).
---
--- a/toolkit/components/search/SearchSuggestionController.sys.mjs
+++ b/toolkit/components/search/SearchSuggestionController.sys.mjs
@@ -36,6 +36,14 @@
     pref: "browser.search.suggest.timeout",
     default: REMOTE_TIMEOUT_DEFAULT,
   },
+  /**
+   * Nulavio: ids of the engines the user allowed to receive what they type,
+   * comma-separated. Empty means no engine gets remote suggestion requests.
+   */
+  nulavioSuggestConsent: {
+    pref: "nulavio.search.suggest.optin",
+    default: "",
+  },
 });
 
 /**
@@ -229,6 +237,21 @@
   static REMOTE_TIMEOUT_DEFAULT = REMOTE_TIMEOUT_DEFAULT;
 
   /**
+   * Nulavio: whether the user allowed this engine to receive what they type.
+   * Remote suggestions (and trending searches) need this consent in addition
+   * to the upstream switches, so an alias such as "@engine" cannot send
+   * keystrokes to an engine the user did not choose for suggestions.
+   *
+   * @param {SearchEngine} engine - The search engine
+   * @returns {boolean} True if the user opted in for this engine.
+   */
+  static nulavioHasSuggestConsent(engine) {
+    return lazy.nulavioSuggestConsent
+      .split(",")
+      .some(id => id.trim() && id.trim() === engine.id);
+  }
+
+  /**
    * Determines whether the given engine offers search suggestions.
    *
    * @param {SearchEngine} engine - The search engine
@@ -339,7 +362,8 @@
       lazy.suggestionsEnabled &&
       (!inPrivateBrowsing || lazy.suggestionsInPrivateBrowsingEnabled) &&
       maxRemoteResults &&
-      SearchSuggestionController.engineOffersSuggestions(engine, fetchTrending)
+      SearchSuggestionController.engineOffersSuggestions(engine, fetchTrending) &&
+      SearchSuggestionController.nulavioHasSuggestConsent(engine)
     ) {
       promises.push(this.#fetchRemote(this.#context));
     }
